  "question": {
    "text": "Maximum number of isomeric monochloro derivatives which can be obtained from 2,2,5,5- tetramethylhexane by chlorination is _________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given alkane&nbsp;2,2,5,5- tetramethylhexane&nbsp;has two types hydrogen, hence, it forms two different structural isomers on chlorination.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9884fd62-3f7e-43fd-adcc-1797ef236059-83942cca-4909-47ac-96d7-c852de2f9932-9894330.png\" style=\"width: 355px; height: 462px;\" /></p><p>Total numbers of isomers are equal to three as second molecule is optically active.</p>",
    "image": null
